{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06642","headline":"登戏马台作 · 储光羲","name":"登戏马台作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君不见宋公仗钺诛燕後，英雄踊跃争趋走。\n小会衣冠吕梁壑，大徵甲卒碻磝口。\n天门神武树元勳，九日茱萸飨六军。\n泛泛楼船游极浦，摇摇歌吹动浮云。\n居人满目市朝变，覇业犹存齐楚甸。\n泗水南流桐柏川，沂山北走琅琊县。\n沧海沈沈晨雾开，彭城烈烈秋风来。\n少年自古未得意，日暮萧条登古台。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06642.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06642","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}